      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="COLD HEART" id="b5fa-b378-fff6-8de0" hidden="false" targetId="3742-1bf9-a0f8-0b11" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Lord of Hate" id="ff8b-b291-8abe-5fca" hidden="false" typeId="fe4c-5b77-ab77-e578" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5cee-5283-c95d-c323">Once per turn, this model is leading a unit, you may select **one** of the following abilities to perform.

**During your Movement Phase**, the bearer&apos;s unit must perform a Composure Test. On a 6+, increase the Movement Characteristic of all models in this unit by 1&quot; until the end of this phase. On a 10+, additionally improve the Save Roll Characteristic of models in the bearer&apos;s unit by 1.

**During your Charge Phase**, before making a Charge Roll, the bearer&apos;s unit must perform a Composure Test. On a 6+, add 1 to the total result of that Charge Roll. On a 10+, additionally improve the bearer&apos;s Close Combat Characteristic by 1 until the end of your turn.

**During any Fight Phase**, the bearer&apos;s unit must perform a Composure Test. On a 6+, the bearer&apos;s unit receive a +1 to hit rolls until the end of this phase. On a 10+, they additionally receive a +1 to wound rolls until the end of this phase.


If any of these tests fail, the bearer&apos;s unit suffers D3 Mortal Wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Tormentor" id="0130-7313-1031-73ec" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="a1bc-3842-9985-4e9f-min" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="a1bc-3842-9985-4e9f-max" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
